# Python 3.10 packages for scripts/unimedvl_server.py (issue #6).
#
# Based on the pip section of codes/environment.yaml in
# https://github.com/uni-medical/UniMedVL at commit
# f51aa0accbd02e846e5ea20b595fb39b516dbe1f (Python 3.10.18). Only the
# Jupyter packages are left out; the server does not use a notebook.
# flash-attn is installed separately from a SHA-256-pinned wheel by
# scripts/medbench-model-run.sh, because upstream adds it by hand.
#
# scripts/unimedvl-requirements.txt is the full lock compiled from this file
# (every transitive package pinned); after editing a pin here, regenerate it:
#
#   uv pip compile scripts/unimedvl-requirements.in \
#     -o scripts/unimedvl-requirements.txt --python-version 3.10 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --annotation-style line \
#     --custom-compile-command "see scripts/unimedvl-requirements.in"
#
# Every package is at its newest release for Python 3.10 (issue #19), except:
#   torch 2.8.0 (torchvision 0.23.0, triton 3.4.0 follow it): the newest torch
#     with a prebuilt flash-attn wheel (v2.8.3.post2 ships cu12torch2.4-2.8);
#     torch 2.9+ would need flash-attn built from source on the GPU host.
#   transformers 4.57.6, the last 4.x: upstream's Qwen2 and SigLIP copies
#     import 4.x internals; on 5.x, building the model fails with
#     KeyError: 'default' (ROPE_INIT_FUNCTIONS) and, patched past that,
#     generates different tokens. tokenizers 0.22.2 is the newest it accepts.
# experiments/issue19_unimedvl_cpu_smoke.py runs upstream's chat() on the CPU
# with a tiny random model and generates the same tokens on these pins as on
# the previous ones (torch 2.6.0, transformers 4.49.0, numpy 1.24.4).
# The advisories left in torch and transformers are accepted one by one, with
# the reason they do not apply, in scripts/audit_dependencies.py.
torch==2.8.0
torchvision==0.23.0
triton==3.4.0
transformers==4.57.6
accelerate==1.15.0
safetensors==0.8.0
tokenizers==0.22.2
sentencepiece==0.2.2
pillow==12.3.0
numpy==2.2.6
opencv-python==5.0.0.93
einops==0.8.2
matplotlib==3.10.9
contourpy==1.3.2
cycler==0.12.1
fonttools==4.65.0
kiwisolver==1.5.1
packaging==26.3
pyparsing==3.3.3
python-dateutil==2.9.0.post0
